				dist: [['〈thinking〉', 0.62], [' A', 0.14], [' Let', 0.09], [' First', 0.06], [' Great', 0.03]],
				moral: 'On problems with checkable answers it learned to <b>think in tokens</b> before answering. More tokens, more computation, often better answers.' },
